      "role": "user",
      "content": "ok got it. so if the seller is providing the insurance, does the contract need to specify the exact amount and the clause used? i want to make sure there isn't any ambiguity about who files the claim if something happens midway through the ocean. also, does the seller have any control over which insurance company is used?",
